The following MaterialX files were ported to Rust and WGSL; the port changes them as
recorded in the crate documentation (reflection-only standard_surface subset, analytic
directional albedo, two Airy iterations, Airy phase range reduction, exact-zero
hemisphere rule, delta GGX lobes, disc-light NDF widening):

  libraries/bxdf/standard_surface.mtlx
  libraries/pbrlib/pbrlib_defs.mtlx
  libraries/pbrlib/genglsl/lib/mx_microfacet.glsl
  libraries/pbrlib/genglsl/lib/mx_microfacet_specular.glsl
